            "degree_six_union_of_H_H_4H_source_equations_is_emitted": True,
            "all33_principal_s_union_directions_lie_in_the_full_kernel": True,
            "F0_plus_the33_principal_directions_have_rank34": True,
            "exactly89_additional_kernel_directions_complete_the_projective_tangent": True,
            "the_projective_graph_preserving_tangent_has_rank122": True,
            "the_true_incidence_normal_quotient_has_rank126": True,
            "the_old_rank215_slice_quotient_splits_dimensionally_as89_plus126": True,
            "kernel_frame_plus126_incidence_complement_columns_has_rank249": True,
        },
        "theorem": {
            "name": "FullGraphIncidenceTangentAndNormalDecompositionTheorem",
            "statement": (
                "On the selected eta9 residue carrier, the three-graph incidence map V_249 to R_126 has "
                "rank 126 and kernel K of rank 123. The selected member F and the 33 principal s_union*H "
                "directions span rank 34 inside K. A canonical exact extension supplies 89 further "
